    "first_lines": [
      {
        "text": "ABSTRACT",
        "x0": 284.93,
        "x1": 354.15,
        "top": 99.77,
        "bottom": 115.73
      },
      {
        "text": "I have been using TrueShield AI for a few months. It feels like a real guardian for my",
        "x0": 116.54,
        "x1": 523.0,
        "top": 138.02,
        "bottom": 150.02
      },
      {
        "text": "phone. TrueShield AI is a on\u2011device system that uses two engines to spot and stop",
        "x0": 116.54,
        "x1": 515.88,
        "top": 159.64,
        "bottom": 171.98
      },
      {
        "text": "scam calls while they happen. It is built to keep phone users safe from voice",
        "x0": 116.54,
        "x1": 485.55,
        "top": 181.94,
        "bottom": 193.94
      },
      {
        "text": "phishing, financial tricks and fake identity theft. With fraud growing through VoIP",
        "x0": 116.54,
        "x1": 512.11,
        "top": 203.9,
        "bottom": 215.9
      }
    ],
    "last_lines": [
      {
        "text": "and caught 93.6% of all real scams. The whole process takes than 1.9 seconds so the",
        "x0": 116.54,
        "top": 621.46
      },
      {
        "text": "user sees a warning almost instantly. TrueShield AI keeps the user\u2019s privacy safe.",
        "x0": 116.54,
        "top": 643.42
      },
      {
        "text": "5",
