      {
        "text": "1.1 Background and Motivation",
        "x0": 108.02,
        "x1": 288.29,
        "top": 79.85,
        "bottom": 93.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Nowadays smartphones and digital platforms are essential for communication. People",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 532.45,
        "top": 105.02,
        "bottom": 117.02
      },
      {
        "text": "use their phones to talk do banking and make online payments. With this growing use",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 530.24,
        "top": 126.98,
        "bottom": 138.98
      },
      {
        "text": "of technology there has also been a rise in cybercrimes. One of the common forms is",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 524.5,
        "top": 148.94,
        "bottom": 160.94
      },
      {
        "text": "vishing.",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 149.2,
        "top": 170.9,
        "bottom": 182.9
      }
    ],
    "last_lines": [
      {
        "text": "spoofed caller IDs, VoIP networks and convincing scripts to trick users. They often",
        "x0": 108.02,
        "top": 700.18
      },
      {
        "text": "target details like one-time passwords, bank login info or KYC data.",
        "x0": 108.02,
        "top": 722.14
      },
