    "page": 15,
    "first_lines": [
      {
        "text": "2.1 Introduction",
        "x0": 108.02,
        "x1": 202.06,
        "top": 76.01,
        "bottom": 90.05
      },
      {
        "text": "Fast growth in communication technology has changed how people talk, do business",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 524.58,
        "top": 103.34,
        "bottom": 115.34
      },
      {
        "text": "and use online services.",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 227.84,
        "top": 125.3,
        "bottom": 137.3
      },
      {
        "text": "Advances in smartphones, VoIP, digital banking and cloud communication have made",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 528.03,
        "top": 147.26,
        "bottom": 159.26
      },
      {
        "text": "talking easier and more convenient.",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 287.04,
        "top": 169.34,
        "bottom": 181.34
      }
    ],
    "last_lines": [
      {
        "text": "Over the ten years fake phone activities have changed from simple automated calls",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "top": 696.7
      },
      {
        "text": "and annoying telemarketing into very specific cyber attacks. In the days phone scams",
