        "bottom": 112.34
      },
      {
        "text": "transactions effortless, but they have also created new openings for cyber criminals.",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 520.34,
        "top": 116.06,
        "bottom": 128.06
      },
      {
        "text": "Telephone fraud, particularly voice phishing (vishing), has become much harder to stop",
        "x0": 112.22,
        "x1": 534.33,
        "top": 131.9,
        "bottom": 143.9
      },
      {
        "text": "than spam emails or SMS fraud. Scammers rely on live psychological manipulation\u2014",
