        "text": "4.5 Tools and Technologies Used",
        "x0": 113.66,
        "x1": 275.49,
        "top": 79.34,
        "bottom": 91.34
      },
      {
        "text": "Developing TrueShield AI required selecting tools that could handle real-time",
        "x0": 113.66,
        "x1": 489.05,
        "top": 123.26,
        "bottom": 135.26
      },
      {
        "text": "streaming speech while maintaining low memory consumption and strict data privacy",
        "x0": 113.66,
        "x1": 530.71,
        "top": 145.34,
        "bottom": 157.34
      },
      {
